          "question": "What does the document say about energy storage?",
          "answer": "Tesla achieved its highest quarterly energy storage deployments, driven by record Megapack deployments. [[cite:1]]\n\nEnergy gross profit reached a record $1.1 billion, marking the fifth consecutive record quarter. [[cite:1]]\n\nTesla also plans to begin Megapack 3 and Megablock production at Megafactory Houston in 2026. [[cite:1]]",
