          "question": "What production plans does Tesla mention for 2026?",
          "answer": "Tesla says Cybercab, Tesla Semi, and Megapack 3 are on schedule for volume production starting in 2026. [[cite:1]]\n\nThe same product update also notes that first-generation Optimus production lines are being installed before volume production. [[cite:1]]",
